  "title": "Three Cheese Ham Involtini",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s cheesy ham roll-ups are like cheese cannelloni, but with ham instead of pasta. It&#39;s a quick and easy dinner that&#39;s perfect for a weeknight meal. Serve over mashed potatoes, pasta, polenta, or rice.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
